## Setup

1. Install [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/).
2. Run `uv sync`. It installs Python, Quarto, and the other tools.
3. Enable the pre-commit hook: `git config core.hooksPath .githooks`.

## Python version

The Python version is set in `.python-version`, and uv installs it when needed.

- To use another version that `requires-python` in `pyproject.toml` allows, run
  `uv python pin <version>`, then `uv sync`.
- For an older version, lower `requires-python` first, then run `uv lock`,
  `uv python pin <version>`, and `uv sync`.

A different Python version is outside the tested configuration.
